"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/AllCliques":{"abstract":[{"text":"Every clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph whose size is in a range, once each, lazily,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order (by vertex index). The order is by the cliques’ first vertex in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"text":", then depth first, each clique followed by its extensions by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later vertices in ascending index. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating again gives the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d) bitset words per clique for degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"title":"AllCliques","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/AllCliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/allcliques","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AllCliques","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/AllCliques/Element":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Element"}],"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/allcliques\/element","title":"AllCliques.Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/AllCliques\/Element","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Element"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","role":"collection","title":"Cliques